    <string name="gomoku_coach_title">New to Gomoku?</string>
    <string name="gomoku_coach_body">Tap a point to select it, then tap it again (or press Place stone) to play. Block your opponent’s open threes and fours before they turn into five, and build your own. Gomoku means \"five points\" in Japanese.</string>
